          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (fifth section of join): Moss. I,81C verso + Moss. I,81B verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[ ... ... ] Yehudah Iscariota, and Shime\u02bfon Kepha,</li>\n<li>and Binyamin Altigus, and three men with him</li>\n<li>[ ... ... ]</li>\n<li>C[ae]sar [ ... ]</li>\n<li>[And they brou]ght Yoh\u0323anan, the teacher [of Yeshu,</li>\n<li>and placed him] before R. Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah</li>\n<li>[and before Marinus the e]lder of the Jews, and before</li>\n<li>[ ... ... ] and Rabbi Yehudah the gardener</li>\n<li>[ ... ... ] And they asked Yoh\u0323anan [and Yeshu?]:&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&ldquo;[ ... ... ] people, the servants</li>\n<li>[of Yeshu? ...].&rdquo; And he said:&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&ldquo;[ .... ].&rdquo; [And he ask?]ed: &ldquo;And what</li>\n<li>[are their names?&rdquo; And he said? &ldquo;... ...],</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
